  "question": {
    "text": "A force of $40 \\mathrm{~N}$ acts on a point $\\mathrm{B}$ at the end of an L-shaped object, as shown in the figure. The angle $\\theta$ that will produce maximum moment of the force about point $\\mathrm{A}$ is given by:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/MR7QSZ685IlP_rfw3h8qmffQ8dVglJVyQY6oOD2Ul90.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1esKJ",
      "text": "\n$\\tan \\theta=\\frac{1}{4}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "X0XVP",
      "text": "\n$\\tan \\theta=2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "eLXgK",
      "text": "\n$\\tan \\theta=\\frac{1}{2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sJJHp",
      "text": "\n $\\tan \\theta=4$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "To produce maximum moment of force line of action of force must be perpendicular to line $\\mathrm{AB}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Qgox5Ro3tkhJNa6fP_OSQ0onrp7tPbRVBRIHNCkr8TQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\therefore \\tan \\theta=\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
